  "translation": "Gomme Khizkiyahu a robala le bo-ntate wa hae, gomme ba mo phekola go sehubja sa mafelo a bohoko a bana ba Dafida; gomme kgethišo ba e dira ⟨go⟩ yena lehu la gage, Yuda ka moka le ba dulago Yerushalayime; gomme Morwe Manashe, mora wa gae, a bogoši mo boemong bja gagwe.",
